      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "> Maximizing shields also does not work since disabling shaders and only showing avatar mesh can have NSFW content.\n\nThis is related to another feature request I've seen. Ability to test avatar with \"shaders off\" to verify proper fallback.\n\nHopefully VRChat makes avatar creators more easily see issues with construction.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
